{"id":"m4-158","m":4,"paper":"2019年1月天津市定向招录选调生考试综合能力测试试卷（精选）","region":"天津","year":2019,"q":5,"multi":0,"groups":[{"material":null,"qs":[{"n":1,"qid":"2661738","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"一个边长为8的立方体，由若干个边长为1的正立方体组成，现在要在表面涂上颜色，问被涂上颜色的小立方体有多少个？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"296"},{"k":"B","t":"325"},{"k":"C","t":"328"},{"k":"D","t":"384"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>由题意可知，该正方体共由<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-475f716e082dbb6d.png\" />个小立方体组成，去除被涂色的小立方体，剩下没被涂色的是一个棱长为6的立方体，即有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-8be2c65438d8d954.png\" />个小立方体。因此一共有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-028fba9ea88ade5d.png\" />个小立方体被涂上了颜色。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"},{"n":2,"qid":"34637","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某一天，小张发现办公桌上的台历已经有7天没有翻了，就一次翻了7张，这7张的日期加起来之和是77，那么这一天是：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"13日"},{"k":"B","t":"14日"},{"k":"C","t":"15日"},{"k":"D","t":"17日"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>这7个日期是连续的自然数，构成等差数列，则这7个日期的中位数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a7b33be0a15d91bb.png\" />，即没翻日历的第四天是11日，则这7天分别为8、9、10、11、12、13、14日，所以今天应该是15日。</p><p>故正确答案为C。 </p>"},{"n":3,"qid":"15755","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"一试卷有50道判断题，规定每做对一题得3分，不做或做错一题扣1分。某学生共得82分，问做对的题与不做或做错的题数相差几题：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"15题"},{"k":"B","t":"16题"},{"k":"C","t":"17题"},{"k":"D","t":"18题"}],"ans":["B"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>设做对<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c11b84086f002e58.png\" />题，不做或做错<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-c48d18c33af190fa.png\" />题，根据题意可得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a7d4923f995bee63.png\" />······①，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-edf0b8ece1d5e7d0.png\" />······②，联立①②解得：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a7c6cad4bb90e65a.png\" />，<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-7d78cac1fd4b43c9.png\" />。则做对的题与不做或做错的题数相差<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-1037b78347c9ee54.png\" />题。</p><p>故正确答案为B。</p>"},{"n":4,"qid":"15747","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"汽车从甲地到乙地用了4小时，从乙地返回甲地用了3小时，返回时的速度比去时快百分之几：","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"20%"},{"k":"B","t":"18.26%"},{"k":"C","t":"33.3%"},{"k":"D","t":"36.4%"}],"ans":["C"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>题干中只给出了时间，路程和速度都是未知且路程不变，故可赋值不变量路程为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-365aa89c2b340ed8.png\" />，则去时速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4339be147772de50.png\" />，返回时速度为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-2967f2605e8dd6a6.png\" />，返回时的速度比去时快<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-a4c64e63067055a0.png\" />。</p><p>故正确答案为C。<br></p>"},{"n":5,"qid":"2661742","tag":"数学运算","type":"single","stem":"某局机关正在组织人力编辑一本《文本汇编》，其页数需用6869个数字，请问，这本《文本汇编》具体是多少页？","opts":[{"k":"A","t":"1994"},{"k":"B","t":"1968"},{"k":"C","t":"1942"},{"k":"D","t":"1886"}],"ans":["A"],"missing":false,"analysis":"<p>1-9页每页需要1个数字，共需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f4dd527c735ec572.png\" />个数字；</p><p>10-99页每页需要2个数字，共需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-be022784237c0121.png\" />个数字；</p><p>100-999页每页需要3个数字，共需要<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-aa617dea0ce29186.png\" />个数字。</p><p>1000页以上的每页需要4个数字，剩下的数字有<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-4d330fdb1d433a65.png\" /><img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-ba19e0a617694053.png\" />个，需要的页数为<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-f5baae4a0ff58e4d.png\" />。因此本书的总页数为：<img flag=\"tex\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ERRRC/xingcezhenti/main/90-%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87/%E5%85%AC%E5%BC%8F%E5%9B%BE/formula-e8533484a879338f.png\" />页。</p><p>故正确答案为A。</p>"}]}]}